My final recommendation
Build the first version around three primary conversion paths:
Path 1: Free website and SEO audit
Attract interested businesses, collect useful details and qualify opportunities.
Path 2: Book a discovery meeting
Let serious prospects choose an available time and enter your sales pipeline.
Path 3: Request a project proposal
Capture scope, budget and timeline from businesses that already know what they need.
All three paths should feed into one CRM, with source tracking, assigned ownership, next-action reminders and clear sales stages.
One important question before deciding the exact website structure: Are you planning to build your agency website using WordPress, or do you want a custom-coded website using HTML/CSS/JavaScript or React? That determines the best way to implement the forms, booking, SEO controls and CRM integrations.